<section class="eoc-content"><header class="eoc-creation-header"><h2>{{actor.name}} · Creation &amp; Advancement</h2><button type="button" data-action="refresh" {{#if busy}}disabled{{/if}}>Refresh Choices &amp; XP</button><div class="eoc-xp-summary"><strong>{{balance.general}} General XP</strong><strong>{{balance.restricted}} Technique-only XP</strong><span>{{balance.spent}} spent / {{balance.gained}} gained</span></div></header>
<nav class="eoc-import-tabs">{{#each steps}}<button type="button" data-action="step" data-step="{{id}}" class="{{#if active}}selected{{/if}}" {{#if ../busy}}disabled{{/if}}>{{label}}</button>{{/each}}</nav>
{{#if error}}<p class="eoc-import-error" role="alert">{{error}}</p>{{/if}}
<fieldset class="eoc-creation-body" {{#if busy}}disabled{{/if}}>
{{#if profileStep}}{{#if initialized}}<p>This character already has advancement data. Existing attributes and XP are preserved. Use the Profession and Technique tabs to spend XP.</p>{{else}}
<p>EoC Playtest creation: 1,000 XP; 100 XP buys your Specialist Trait. Undiscovered Nature adds 500 XP usable only for Techniques.</p>
<div class="eoc-grid"><label>Name<input data-profile="name" value="{{profile.name}}"></label><label>Heritage<select data-profile="heritage"><option value="">Choose later</option>{{selectOptions heritages selected=profile.heritage valueAttr="value" labelAttr="label"}}</select></label><label>Age<input data-profile="age" value="{{profile.age}}"></label><label>Gender<input data-profile="gender" value="{{profile.gender}}"></label></div>
<h3>Roll or Choose from the Book</h3><div class="eoc-creation-tables">{{#each tables}}<div><label>{{label}} <small>PDF p.{{page}}</small><select data-profile="{{id}}"><option value="">Choose…</option>{{selectOptions choices selected=value valueAttr="value" labelAttr="label"}}</select></label><button type="button" data-action="rollTable" data-table="{{id}}">Roll d100</button></div>{{/each}}</div>
<p class="eoc-muted">The printed alignment table overlaps at 96; the first printed matching row is used.</p>
<h3>Primary Attributes</h3><button type="button" data-action="rollAttributes">Roll Seven Attributes · 2d10+35</button>{{#if rolled}}<p>{{values}}. Assign each roll once. The Profession's +5 adjustment is applied on initialization.</p><div class="eoc-grid">{{#each attributes}}<label>{{label}}<select data-assignment="{{key}}">{{selectOptions choices selected=assignment valueAttr="value" labelAttr="label"}}</select></label>{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}
<label>Unique memento<input data-profile="memento" value="{{profile.memento}}"></label><button type="button" data-action="initialize" {{#unless rolled}}disabled{{/unless}}>Initialize New Character · Buy Specialist Trait for 100 XP</button>
{{/if}}<details><summary>Table roll history</summary>{{#each history}}<p>{{label}}: {{#if total}}{{total}} → {{/if}}{{result}} (PDF p.{{page}})</p>{{/each}}</details>{{/if}}
{{#if advancesStep}}<p>Each available Profession advance costs 100 General XP. Skill ranks increase by +10% and Bonus Advances increase the related Bonus by +1.</p>{{#if hasHeritage}}<button type="button" data-action="heritage">Edit Heritage Bonuses &amp; Choices</button>{{/if}}
{{#each advances}}<div class="eoc-creation-advance"><span><strong>{{name}}</strong><small>{{profession}} · {{group}}</small></span><button type="button" data-action="buy" data-profession="{{professionId}}" data-group="{{group}}" data-index="{{index}}" {{#unless canBuy}}disabled{{/unless}}>{{#if completed}}Purchased{{else}}Buy · 100 XP{{/if}}</button></div>{{else}}<p>Initialize your character or add a Profession to see its advances.</p>{{/each}}
{{/if}}
{{#if techniquesStep}}<p>{{techniqueCount}} / {{limit}} Techniques known. Matching Chakra Nature halves learning XP. The Technique-only balance is spent first.</p><input type="search" data-technique-search value="{{query}}" placeholder="Search name, nature, rank, or Technique type"><label><input type="checkbox" data-affordable-only {{checked affordableOnly}}> Show only affordable, learnable Techniques</label>
{{#each techniques}}<div class="eoc-item-row"><button type="button" class="eoc-item-name" data-action="view" data-uuid="{{uuid}}" data-tooltip-html="{{tooltip}}" data-tooltip-class="eoc-rules-tooltip">{{name}}<small>{{system.jutsuType}} · {{system.jutsuRank}} · {{system.nature}}</small></button><span>{{#if priced}}{{#if discounted}}{{base}} → {{/if}}{{cost}} XP{{else}}Set an explicit XP cost{{/if}}</span><button type="button" data-action="learn" data-uuid="{{uuid}}" {{#unless canBuy}}disabled{{/unless}}>Learn</button></div>{{else}}<p>No affordable Techniques match, or the Technique limit has been reached.</p>{{/each}}
<p class="eoc-muted">Rank prices: E 100, D 200, C 300, B 400, A 500, S 600 XP. An explicit learning XP cost on the Item replaces the rank price. Draft Techniques are hidden until configured.</p>{{/if}}
{{#if ledgerStep}}<h3>Experience Ledger</h3>{{#each ledger}}<div class="eoc-creation-advance"><span>{{label}}<small>{{time}}</small></span><strong>{{#if amount}}+{{amount}} gained{{else}}{{cost}} XP{{#if restricted}} · {{restricted}} Technique-only{{/if}}{{/if}}</strong></div>{{else}}<p>No purchases recorded through this tool yet. Existing sheet XP totals are included in the balance.</p>{{/each}}
{{#if gm}}<div class="eoc-inline"><label>XP award<input type="number" data-xp-award min="1" step="1" value="100"></label><button type="button" data-action="award">Award XP</button></div>{{/if}}
{{#if completed}}<p>Character creation completed. Further XP can be spent using the same purchase controls.</p>{{else}}<p>Unspent XP is kept for later advancement. Set any Heritage bonus choices on its Item sheet, and choose your starting equipment from the Profession's rules.</p><button type="button" data-action="finish" {{#unless initialized}}disabled{{/unless}}>Finish Character Creation</button>{{/if}}{{/if}}
</fieldset></section>
